# Normalise line endings inside the repository.
#
# The CI gate runs `moon fmt` followed by `git diff --exit-code`, so the bytes
# MoonBit sees must not depend on the platform that checked the repo out.
# Storing LF and checking LF out everywhere keeps that gate meaningful on
# Linux, macOS and Windows alike.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts that must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.wasm binary
